Are you prepared to explore the realm of real-time communication and networking?  We'll use Node.js to create a straightforward yet effective TCP chat application in this step-by-step tutorial! 🌟
What is TCP? 🤔
Prerequisites 🛠️
Node.js installed on your machine
A code editor (VS Code recommended)
Basic JavaScript knowledge
Terminal/Command Prompt access
Step 1: Setting Up the Project 📁
mkdir tcp-chat-app
cd tcp-chat-app
npm init -y

That's it! We don't need any external dependencies since Node.js has built-in modules for TCP networking. 🎉
